  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\tVì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đều cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> đối xứng với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình  thoi.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.\t\n\t\t\t\tTừ (1), (2) suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Kẻ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (c.c.c)\n\t\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>K</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>p</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/33ae0e36234254c4c04d234de6bb2bbc5160328ea0b4b939e54b5f445208019a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div><div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div>",
